# 🛍️ SHOPIFY BEST-IN-CLASS TEMPLATE - KORJATTU

## ✅ KRIITTISET KORJAUKSET:

### 1️⃣ **Header.liquid** - Shopify-standardeilla
```liquid
<header class="site-header" role="banner">
  <div class="container header-bar">
    <a class="logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">HerbSpot</a>

    <nav class="main-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Primary">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/collections/all" aria-current="{{ request.path contains '/collections' | default: '' }}">
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}
            {% when 'fi' %}Tuotteet{% when 'ru' %}Товары{% else %}Products{% endcase %}
        </a></li>
        <li><a href="/pages/wellness-paths">
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}
            {% when 'fi' %}Hyvinvoinnin polut{% when 'ru' %}Пути велнеса{% else %}Wellness Paths{% endcase %}
        </a></li>
        <li><a href="/blogs/journal">
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}
            {% when 'fi' %}Journal{% when 'ru' %}Журнал{% else %}Journal{% endcase %}
        </a></li>
        <li><a href="/pages/support">
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}
            {% when 'fi' %}Tuki{% when 'ru' %}Поддержка{% else %}Support{% endcase %}
        </a></li>
        <li><a href="/pages/b2b">
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}
            {% when 'fi' %}B2B-palvelut{% when 'ru' %}B2B-услуги{% else %}B2B Services{% endcase %}
        </a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-actions">
      <!-- Language switch -->
      <details class="locale-switcher">
        <summary>
          {% case localization.language.iso_code %}{% when 'fi' %}FI{% when 'ru' %}RU{% else %}EN{% endcase %}
        </summary>
        <ul>
          {% for locale in shop.published_locales %}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ locale.root_url }}"
                 hreflang="{{ locale.iso_code }}"
                 aria-current="{% if locale.iso_code == localization.language.iso_code %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
                {% case locale.iso_code %}{% when 'fi' %}Suomi{% when 'ru' %}Русский{% else %}English{% endcase %}
              </a>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </details>

      <a class="cart-link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart">🛒</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
```

